<script setup lang="ts">import {Result} from '../types/domain';import {number,percent} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{result:Result}>();const colors=['var(--char)','var(--lime)','var(--clay)','var(--ochre)','var(--sage)'];</script><template><section class="group-profiles"><div class="section-top"><h3>组CLR均值与组成中心</h3><span>均值在CLR空间，中心回到闭合空间</span></div><div class="profile-legend"><span v-for="(c,i) in result.components" :key="c.code"><i :style="{background:colors[i]}"/>{{c.label}}</span></div><div v-for="g in result.statistics.groups" :key="g.group" class="group-row"><div class="group-label"><b>{{g.group}}</b><small>n={{g.n}}</small></div><div class="group-band"><span v-for="(v,i) in g.aitchison_center" :key="i" :style="{width:(v*100)+'%',background:colors[i]}" :title="result.components[i].label+' '+percent(v)">{{v>.1?percent(v):''}}</span></div><div class="group-spread"><b>{{number(g.mean_distance_to_centroid,3)}}</b><small>平均到组CLR质心距离</small></div></div><div class="clr-mean-matrix"><table><thead><tr><th>CLR均值</th><th v-for="c in result.components" :key="c.code">{{c.label}}</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="g in result.statistics.groups" :key="g.group"><td>{{g.group}}</td><td v-for="(v,i) in g.mean_clr" :key="i" :class="v>0?'positive':'negative'">{{number(v,4)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>条带为closure(exp(组CLR均值))的Aitchison中心，不是原份额算术均值。组内距离仅描述，未正式检验离散度同质。</p></section></template>
